Fonts for the front panel (panda-lcd), drawn without antialiasing.

tahoma.ttf, tahomabd.ttf
    Wine's Tahoma (Regular, Bold), from https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine
    (fonts/, fetched 2026-11-05). Made to match Microsoft Tahoma's metrics and
    look, with bitmap strikes for small sizes. Copyright (c) 1993-2026 the Wine
    project authors. LGPL 2.1 or later: COPYING.LIB. Sources: fonts/tahoma.sfd
    and fonts/tahomabd.sfd in the Wine repository.

VT323-Regular.ttf
    VT323 by Peter Hull, from https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/vt323,
    fetched 2026-11-05). SIL Open Font License 1.1: OFL.txt.
